    "floorPlans": "Eighteen developer apartment sheets, fourteen developer XX-series penthouse sheets, five individually numbered stack sheets, and two shared penthouse plates. All unit, type, total and component fields read from visible panels. Apartment sheets 6 and 9 differ by 0.1 m², page 14 by 2.6 m². Page 3 prints a stack ending on floor 55 although the PDF filename ends in 53. Source floor ranges and units are retained."
  },
